  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上一集我们说到王成书本可以拿诺贝尔奖，却在一九六四年原子弹爆炸成功后从人间蒸发一消失就是三十年。很多人看完问他到底图什么？一个站在世界物理学顶端的人，为什么心甘情愿把名字抹掉？今天这集答案从他被美国扣留的那七年讲起。你听我讲说，讲完就知道这个女人的骨头比你想的硬的多。一九五一年，美国密歇根大学有个中国女学者，正站在人生的巅峰。她叫王成书，丈夫研究员两度受邀进普林斯顿高级研究所，那是爱因斯坦待过的地方。丈夫张文玉同样是顶尖物理学家，就在这一年，她又扔出一颗炸弹，跟导是乌伦贝克一起解开了困扰国际学界几十年的气体疏于难题，方程直接以他的姓氏命名WCU方程震惊了全世界导师乌伦贝克最后说了一句话，他留在美国诺贝尔奖只是时间问题。可就在所有人都以为他要在美国大展拳脚的时候，这家人开始变卖家里的东西了。杀伐送人电器送人能送的全送，然后开始一箱一箱打包书籍寄往北京，不是一次性忌，是分成三百多个包裹跑几十家不同的邮局。今天寄两个，明天寄三个，就像蚂蚁搬家一样，一点一点往国内挪。为什么这么干？因为当时国际包裹现中六磅，而且美国的情报部门早已经盯上了他。一九四九年，新中国一成立，王成书就跟丈夫说，咱们现在回国，美国方面能答应吗？那是朝鲜战争全面爆发，美国方面直接下了禁令，所有学理工科的中国学者不许离境，在这期间传讯监视、限制出行，什么手段都用上。有个美国教授说的特别露骨，这些搞理工的回去就是潜在的核武制造者，他们必须留下。可王成书呢，他在日记里写下了一句话，把自己的退路全部堵死了。经过较长时期的思想斗争，最后下定决心，在必要时，哪怕把我关起来，也不能做一桩，不利于祖国的事儿。你频频这句话，一个已经站在世界物理学顶端的人拿自己的后半生做担保。您可被关起来，也不做对不起祖国的事儿。这不是口号，这是他一步一步在做正确的事。美国不放人，他就硬等等了。七年。这七年里，他一边应付美国情报部门的传讯和监视，一边偷偷把资料往国内寄九百公斤左右的书刊，资料分开成三百多个营包，全是他一个人打包，一个人跑邮局寄出去。你想想那个画面，一个瘦小的中国女人，抱着沉重的书香，在不同的邮局之间穿梭，生怕被人发现，生怕哪一包被截下来，家里的所有东西全送人了。美方开出再优渥的条件，他眼皮都不抬一下，他心里只有一个念头回国。一九五五年，中美在日内瓦会谈国家据理力争，美国才不得不解除禁令放他们回国。一九五六年，一家人终于登上了回国的船。登船之前，导师乌伦贝克最后一次劝他，孩子中国一穷二白，没有仪器，没有资料，你回去能干什么呢？他的回答我建议你记住，虽然我的祖国很穷，进行科研的条件也差，但我不能等别人把条件创造好了，我一定要参加到创造条件的行列中。我的事业必须在中国。这话说完，美国人就来搜身了。箱子翻了个底朝天，人生搜了个遍，连鞋底都撬开检查，生怕他带走什么机密。资料多年后张文玉回忆这段的时光，幽默的让人心酸。闹到最后，我们带回来的就一个脑袋，可他们忘了，那三百个邮包有用的知识，早就邮寄到家了。一九五六年十月，双脚一踏上祖国的土地，王成书就在笔记本上写在离别了十五年的祖国国境上，第一次看到五星红旗在空中飘扬，心里说不出的兴奋。我要为国家做贡献，国家需要要什么我就干什么。你以为这是苦尽甘来不？这才是他被收割的开始，回国才两年。一九五八年，前三强上门找他谈，国家要搞热核巨变，国内一片空白，你来挂帅。他研究了二十年的锡薄气体，跟热核巨变，完全是两码事。他已经四十六岁了，专业早已定型，这等于让他把过去二十年学的知识一笔勾销，重新做回小学生。他只说了三个字，我愿意。然后呢，他自学俄语，被派去苏联进修，从莫斯科回北京，坐了七天七夜的火车。他愣是把美国核聚变规划的机密文献学武德方案给翻译。完了，两年就两。他带出一支队伍，把国内热核聚变理论的空白给填上了，成了中国受控核聚变研究的开创者。四十六岁规定，四十八岁又重新登顶，这就是王成书的宿可刚要出大成果，第二代又来。一九六一年苏联专家卷着图纸跑光原子弹的，命门核燃料浓缩又卡死了。后来钱三强再次找到他谈合作。这次我要把丑话说，前面项目要绝对保密，不能发论文，不能开会，你的去向，连丈夫都不能讲。如果你接下这个项目，王成书这个人就等于从这个世界上抹。除了四十九岁，第二次从零开始，还要搭上不能有自己的名字。他还是那三个字，我愿意一个被美国扣了七年，也要跑回来的女人。回来之后，为国家藏了三十年，藏道走了，都没几个人知道他的名字。回望那段风雨飘摇的岁月，正是有这么一群人，挺身而出，不计个人得失，不怕艰难困苦，默默扛起家国重任。下集，我来讲，他这辈子只跟国家说过三个字，说了三回，每一回都把自己赔进去一点，三回下来，把自己赔的干干净净。这三回，我愿意每一回他失去了什么，国家又得到了什么？我一笔一笔给你算清楚，点赞、收藏并转发给您身边最亲的人。关注我，下一集我继续讲。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 4390,
      "text": "上一集我们说到王成书本可以拿诺贝尔奖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4830,
      "end_ms": 12090,
      "text": "却在一九六四年原子弹爆炸成功后从人间蒸发一消失就是三十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00003",
      "start_ms": 12630,
      "end_ms": 15630,
      "text": "很多人看完问他到底图什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00004",
      "start_ms": 15630,
      "end_ms": 19450,
      "text": "一个站在世界物理学顶端的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00005",
      "start_ms": 19450,
      "end_ms": 22490,
      "text": "为什么心甘情愿把名字抹掉？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00006",
      "start_ms": 22490,
      "end_ms": 28410,
      "text": "今天这集答案从他被美国扣留的那七年讲起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00007",
      "start_ms": 28470,
      "end_ms": 30000,
      "text": "你听我讲说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00008",
      "start_ms": 30140,
      "end_ms": 34780,
      "text": "讲完就知道这个女人的骨头比你想的硬的多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00009",
      "start_ms": 35940,
      "end_ms": 36980,
      "text": "一九五一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00010",
      "start_ms": 36980,
      "end_ms": 39820,
      "text": "美国密歇根大学有个中国女学者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00011",
      "start_ms": 39940,
      "end_ms": 41860,
      "text": "正站在人生的巅峰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00012",
      "start_ms": 42700,
      "end_ms": 43840,
      "text": "她叫王成书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00013",
      "start_ms": 44740,
      "end_ms": 49520,
      "text": "丈夫研究员两度受邀进普林斯顿高级研究所，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00014",
      "start_ms": 50240,
      "end_ms": 52580,
      "text": "那是爱因斯坦待过的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00015",
      "start_ms": 53020,
      "end_ms": 56180,
      "text": "丈夫张文玉同样是顶尖物理学家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00016",
      "start_ms": 56660,
      "end_ms": 57560,
      "text": "就在这一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00017",
      "start_ms": 57780,
      "end_ms": 59300,
      "text": "她又扔出一颗炸弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00018",
      "start_ms": 59460,
      "end_ms": 66075,
      "text": "跟导是乌伦贝克一起解开了困扰国际学界几十年的气体疏于难题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00019",
      "start_ms": 66690,
      "end_ms": 76030,
      "text": "方程直接以他的姓氏命名WCU方程震惊了全世界导师乌伦贝克最后说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00020",
      "start_ms": 76030,
      "end_ms": 79545,
      "text": "他留在美国诺贝尔奖只是时间问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00021",
      "start_ms": 80420,
      "end_ms": 84595,
      "text": "可就在所有人都以为他要在美国大展拳脚的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00022",
      "start_ms": 84890,
      "end_ms": 87685,
      "text": "这家人开始变卖家里的东西了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00023",
      "start_ms": 88110,
      "end_ms": 91755,
      "text": "杀伐送人电器送人能送的全送，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00024",
      "start_ms": 92310,
      "end_ms": 96155,
      "text": "然后开始一箱一箱打包书籍寄往北京，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00025",
      "start_ms": 96900,
      "end_ms": 98295,
      "text": "不是一次性忌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00026",
      "start_ms": 98640,
      "end_ms": 103065,
      "text": "是分成三百多个包裹跑几十家不同的邮局。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00027",
      "start_ms": 103660,
      "end_ms": 104895,
      "text": "今天寄两个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00028",
      "start_ms": 105230,
      "end_ms": 106345,
      "text": "明天寄三个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00029",
      "start_ms": 106800,
      "end_ms": 108335,
      "text": "就像蚂蚁搬家一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00030",
      "start_ms": 108660,
      "end_ms": 110205,
      "text": "一点一点往国内挪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00031",
      "start_ms": 112300,
      "end_ms": 113075,
      "text": "为什么这么干？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00032",
      "start_ms": 113340,
      "end_ms": 115855,
      "text": "因为当时国际包裹现中六磅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00033",
      "start_ms": 116320,
      "end_ms": 119325,
      "text": "而且美国的情报部门早已经盯上了他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00034",
      "start_ms": 120390,
      "end_ms": 121510,
      "text": "一九四九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00035",
      "start_ms": 121570,
      "end_ms": 122830,
      "text": "新中国一成立，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00036",
      "start_ms": 123210,
      "end_ms": 125110,
      "text": "王成书就跟丈夫说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00037",
      "start_ms": 126110,
      "end_ms": 127390,
      "text": "咱们现在回国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00038",
      "start_ms": 127950,
      "end_ms": 129290,
      "text": "美国方面能答应吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00039",
      "start_ms": 129770,
      "end_ms": 131870,
      "text": "那是朝鲜战争全面爆发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00040",
      "start_ms": 132310,
      "end_ms": 134150,
      "text": "美国方面直接下了禁令，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00041",
      "start_ms": 134550,
      "end_ms": 137910,
      "text": "所有学理工科的中国学者不许离境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00042",
      "start_ms": 138810,
      "end_ms": 142650,
      "text": "在这期间传讯监视、限制出行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00043",
      "start_ms": 143070,
      "end_ms": 144370,
      "text": "什么手段都用上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00044",
      "start_ms": 144930,
      "end_ms": 146950,
      "text": "有个美国教授说的特别露骨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00045",
      "start_ms": 147290,
      "end_ms": 151120,
      "text": "这些搞理工的回去就是潜在的核武制造者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00046",
      "start_ms": 151540,
      "end_ms": 152840,
      "text": "他们必须留下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00047",
      "start_ms": 153780,
      "end_ms": 154880,
      "text": "可王成书呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00048",
      "start_ms": 154980,
      "end_ms": 156920,
      "text": "他在日记里写下了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00049",
      "start_ms": 157720,
      "end_ms": 160280,
      "text": "把自己的退路全部堵死了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00050",
      "start_ms": 161160,
      "end_ms": 163580,
      "text": "经过较长时期的思想斗争，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00051",
      "start_ms": 164180,
      "end_ms": 165380,
      "text": "最后下定决心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00052",
      "start_ms": 165800,
      "end_ms": 166840,
      "text": "在必要时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00053",
      "start_ms": 166840,
      "end_ms": 168240,
      "text": "哪怕把我关起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00054",
      "start_ms": 168440,
      "end_ms": 169740,
      "text": "也不能做一桩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00055",
      "start_ms": 169920,
      "end_ms": 171960,
      "text": "不利于祖国的事儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00056",
      "start_ms": 172040,
      "end_ms": 174020,
      "text": "你频频这句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00057",
      "start_ms": 174020,
      "end_ms": 179380,
      "text": "一个已经站在世界物理学顶端的人拿自己的后半生做担保。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00058",
      "start_ms": 179660,
      "end_ms": 180925,
      "text": "您可被关起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00059",
      "start_ms": 181240,
      "end_ms": 183350,
      "text": "也不做对不起祖国的事儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00060",
      "start_ms": 183370,
      "end_ms": 184255,
      "text": "这不是口号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00061",
      "start_ms": 184730,
      "end_ms": 187375,
      "text": "这是他一步一步在做正确的事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00062",
      "start_ms": 187950,
      "end_ms": 188910,
      "text": "美国不放人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00063",
      "start_ms": 188910,
      "end_ms": 190560,
      "text": "他就硬等等了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00064",
      "start_ms": 190560,
      "end_ms": 191115,
      "text": "七年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00065",
      "start_ms": 191590,
      "end_ms": 192485,
      "text": "这七年里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00066",
      "start_ms": 192860,
      "end_ms": 196575,
      "text": "他一边应付美国情报部门的传讯和监视，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00067",
      "start_ms": 197280,
      "end_ms": 202280,
      "text": "一边偷偷把资料往国内寄九百公斤左右的书刊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00068",
      "start_ms": 202300,
      "end_ms": 205005,
      "text": "资料分开成三百多个营包，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00069",
      "start_ms": 205870,
      "end_ms": 207175,
      "text": "全是他一个人打包，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00070",
      "start_ms": 207490,
      "end_ms": 209245,
      "text": "一个人跑邮局寄出去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00071",
      "start_ms": 210010,
      "end_ms": 211245,
      "text": "你想想那个画面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00072",
      "start_ms": 211780,
      "end_ms": 213495,
      "text": "一个瘦小的中国女人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00073",
      "start_ms": 214000,
      "end_ms": 215515,
      "text": "抱着沉重的书香，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00074",
      "start_ms": 215920,
      "end_ms": 218080,
      "text": "在不同的邮局之间穿梭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00075",
      "start_ms": 218240,
      "end_ms": 219585,
      "text": "生怕被人发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00076",
      "start_ms": 219940,
      "end_ms": 221685,
      "text": "生怕哪一包被截下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00077",
      "start_ms": 222310,
      "end_ms": 224395,
      "text": "家里的所有东西全送人了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00078",
      "start_ms": 224920,
      "end_ms": 227075,
      "text": "美方开出再优渥的条件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00079",
      "start_ms": 227460,
      "end_ms": 229135,
      "text": "他眼皮都不抬一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00080",
      "start_ms": 229660,
      "end_ms": 232480,
      "text": "他心里只有一个念头回国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00081",
      "start_ms": 233060,
      "end_ms": 234105,
      "text": "一九五五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00082",
      "start_ms": 234410,
      "end_ms": 237695,
      "text": "中美在日内瓦会谈国家据理力争，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00083",
      "start_ms": 238190,
      "end_ms": 241865,
      "text": "美国才不得不解除禁令放他们回国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00084",
      "start_ms": 242350,
      "end_ms": 243370,
      "text": "一九五六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00085",
      "start_ms": 243630,
      "end_ms": 246425,
      "text": "一家人终于登上了回国的船。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00086",
      "start_ms": 247090,
      "end_ms": 248155,
      "text": "登船之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00087",
      "start_ms": 248910,
      "end_ms": 251510,
      "text": "导师乌伦贝克最后一次劝他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00088",
      "start_ms": 251910,
      "end_ms": 254460,
      "text": "孩子中国一穷二白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00089",
      "start_ms": 254580,
      "end_ms": 255425,
      "text": "没有仪器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00090",
      "start_ms": 255680,
      "end_ms": 256375,
      "text": "没有资料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00091",
      "start_ms": 256670,
      "end_ms": 257935,
      "text": "你回去能干什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00092",
      "start_ms": 258130,
      "end_ms": 260465,
      "text": "他的回答我建议你记住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00093",
      "start_ms": 261000,
      "end_ms": 262705,
      "text": "虽然我的祖国很穷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00094",
      "start_ms": 263470,
      "end_ms": 265605,
      "text": "进行科研的条件也差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00095",
      "start_ms": 266010,
      "end_ms": 268525,
      "text": "但我不能等别人把条件创造好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00096",
      "start_ms": 269040,
      "end_ms": 272575,
      "text": "我一定要参加到创造条件的行列中。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00097",
      "start_ms": 273330,
      "end_ms": 274985,
      "text": "我的事业必须在中国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00098",
      "start_ms": 275790,
      "end_ms": 276505,
      "text": "这话说完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00099",
      "start_ms": 276980,
      "end_ms": 278415,
      "text": "美国人就来搜身了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00100",
      "start_ms": 279020,
      "end_ms": 280705,
      "text": "箱子翻了个底朝天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00101",
      "start_ms": 281220,
      "end_ms": 282365,
      "text": "人生搜了个遍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00102",
      "start_ms": 282960,
      "end_ms": 284855,
      "text": "连鞋底都撬开检查，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00103",
      "start_ms": 285230,
      "end_ms": 286970,
      "text": "生怕他带走什么机密。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00104",
      "start_ms": 286970,
      "end_ms": 290800,
      "text": "资料多年后张文玉回忆这段的时光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00105",
      "start_ms": 290940,
      "end_ms": 292425,
      "text": "幽默的让人心酸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00106",
      "start_ms": 292970,
      "end_ms": 293770,
      "text": "闹到最后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00107",
      "start_ms": 293910,
      "end_ms": 296210,
      "text": "我们带回来的就一个脑袋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00108",
      "start_ms": 296830,
      "end_ms": 297590,
      "text": "可他们忘了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00109",
      "start_ms": 297590,
      "end_ms": 300290,
      "text": "那三百个邮包有用的知识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00110",
      "start_ms": 300490,
      "end_ms": 302070,
      "text": "早就邮寄到家了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00111",
      "start_ms": 302730,
      "end_ms": 304290,
      "text": "一九五六年十月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00112",
      "start_ms": 304790,
      "end_ms": 306990,
      "text": "双脚一踏上祖国的土地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00113",
      "start_ms": 307490,
      "end_ms": 313390,
      "text": "王成书就在笔记本上写在离别了十五年的祖国国境上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00114",
      "start_ms": 313690,
      "end_ms": 316670,
      "text": "第一次看到五星红旗在空中飘扬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00115",
      "start_ms": 317090,
      "end_ms": 318470,
      "text": "心里说不出的兴奋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00116",
      "start_ms": 319110,
      "end_ms": 320990,
      "text": "我要为国家做贡献，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00117",
      "start_ms": 321870,
      "end_ms": 324480,
      "text": "国家需要要什么我就干什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00118",
      "start_ms": 325140,
      "end_ms": 327440,
      "text": "你以为这是苦尽甘来不？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00119",
      "start_ms": 327860,
      "end_ms": 329980,
      "text": "这才是他被收割的开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00120",
      "start_ms": 330940,
      "end_ms": 332260,
      "text": "回国才两年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00121",
      "start_ms": 333040,
      "end_ms": 334120,
      "text": "一九五八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00122",
      "start_ms": 334740,
      "end_ms": 336700,
      "text": "前三强上门找他谈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00123",
      "start_ms": 337620,
      "end_ms": 339620,
      "text": "国家要搞热核巨变，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00124",
      "start_ms": 340360,
      "end_ms": 341960,
      "text": "国内一片空白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00125",
      "start_ms": 343920,
      "end_ms": 344840,
      "text": "你来挂帅。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00126",
      "start_ms": 345320,
      "end_ms": 347640,
      "text": "他研究了二十年的锡薄气体，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00127",
      "start_ms": 348000,
      "end_ms": 349200,
      "text": "跟热核巨变，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00128",
      "start_ms": 349240,
      "end_ms": 350400,
      "text": "完全是两码事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00129",
      "start_ms": 351180,
      "end_ms": 352555,
      "text": "他已经四十六岁了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00130",
      "start_ms": 353350,
      "end_ms": 354625,
      "text": "专业早已定型，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00131",
      "start_ms": 354930,
      "end_ms": 358715,
      "text": "这等于让他把过去二十年学的知识一笔勾销，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00132",
      "start_ms": 359370,
      "end_ms": 361045,
      "text": "重新做回小学生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00133",
      "start_ms": 361440,
      "end_ms": 362835,
      "text": "他只说了三个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00134",
      "start_ms": 363210,
      "end_ms": 363785,
      "text": "我愿意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00135",
      "start_ms": 364420,
      "end_ms": 365095,
      "text": "然后呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00136",
      "start_ms": 365320,
      "end_ms": 366840,
      "text": "他自学俄语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00137",
      "start_ms": 366840,
      "end_ms": 368775,
      "text": "被派去苏联进修，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00138",
      "start_ms": 369360,
      "end_ms": 370705,
      "text": "从莫斯科回北京，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00139",
      "start_ms": 371050,
      "end_ms": 372935,
      "text": "坐了七天七夜的火车。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00140",
      "start_ms": 373620,
      "end_ms": 379030,
      "text": "他愣是把美国核聚变规划的机密文献学武德方案给翻译。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00141",
      "start_ms": 379030,
      "end_ms": 379485,
      "text": "完了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00142",
      "start_ms": 380140,
      "end_ms": 382245,
      "text": "两年就两。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00143",
      "start_ms": 382850,
      "end_ms": 384235,
      "text": "他带出一支队伍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00144",
      "start_ms": 384650,
      "end_ms": 388845,
      "text": "把国内热核聚变理论的空白给填上了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00145",
      "start_ms": 389200,
      "end_ms": 392275,
      "text": "成了中国受控核聚变研究的开创者。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00146",
      "start_ms": 392730,
      "end_ms": 393985,
      "text": "四十六岁规定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00147",
      "start_ms": 394590,
      "end_ms": 396905,
      "text": "四十八岁又重新登顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00148",
      "start_ms": 397450,
      "end_ms": 401295,
      "text": "这就是王成书的宿可刚要出大成果，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00149",
      "start_ms": 401570,
      "end_ms": 402830,
      "text": "第二代又来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00150",
      "start_ms": 404170,
      "end_ms": 408630,
      "text": "一九六一年苏联专家卷着图纸跑光原子弹的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00151",
      "start_ms": 408630,
      "end_ms": 411905,
      "text": "命门核燃料浓缩又卡死了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00152",
      "start_ms": 412450,
      "end_ms": 415435,
      "text": "后来钱三强再次找到他谈合作。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00153",
      "start_ms": 415950,
      "end_ms": 417430,
      "text": "这次我要把丑话说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00154",
      "start_ms": 417430,
      "end_ms": 419635,
      "text": "前面项目要绝对保密，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00155",
      "start_ms": 419920,
      "end_ms": 420615,
      "text": "不能发论文，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00156",
      "start_ms": 421330,
      "end_ms": 422195,
      "text": "不能开会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00157",
      "start_ms": 422580,
      "end_ms": 423320,
      "text": "你的去向，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00158",
      "start_ms": 423340,
      "end_ms": 424595,
      "text": "连丈夫都不能讲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00159",
      "start_ms": 425130,
      "end_ms": 426550,
      "text": "如果你接下这个项目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00160",
      "start_ms": 426550,
      "end_ms": 430100,
      "text": "王成书这个人就等于从这个世界上抹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00161",
      "start_ms": 430100,
      "end_ms": 432080,
      "text": "除了四十九岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00162",
      "start_ms": 432100,
      "end_ms": 433685,
      "text": "第二次从零开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00163",
      "start_ms": 434260,
      "end_ms": 436975,
      "text": "还要搭上不能有自己的名字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00164",
      "start_ms": 437850,
      "end_ms": 439265,
      "text": "他还是那三个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00165",
      "start_ms": 440880,
      "end_ms": 443580,
      "text": "我愿意一个被美国扣了七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00166",
      "start_ms": 443760,
      "end_ms": 445095,
      "text": "也要跑回来的女人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00167",
      "start_ms": 445570,
      "end_ms": 446425,
      "text": "回来之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00168",
      "start_ms": 446750,
      "end_ms": 448255,
      "text": "为国家藏了三十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00169",
      "start_ms": 449150,
      "end_ms": 449950,
      "text": "藏道走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00170",
      "start_ms": 449950,
      "end_ms": 451765,
      "text": "都没几个人知道他的名字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00171",
      "start_ms": 452580,
      "end_ms": 455335,
      "text": "回望那段风雨飘摇的岁月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00172",
      "start_ms": 455980,
      "end_ms": 457460,
      "text": "正是有这么一群人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00173",
      "start_ms": 457520,
      "end_ms": 458695,
      "text": "挺身而出，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00174",
      "start_ms": 459490,
      "end_ms": 460845,
      "text": "不计个人得失，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00175",
      "start_ms": 461260,
      "end_ms": 462525,
      "text": "不怕艰难困苦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00176",
      "start_ms": 462850,
      "end_ms": 465015,
      "text": "默默扛起家国重任。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00177",
      "start_ms": 466020,
      "end_ms": 466440,
      "text": "下集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00178",
      "start_ms": 466440,
      "end_ms": 466935,
      "text": "我来讲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00179",
      "start_ms": 467330,
      "end_ms": 470045,
      "text": "他这辈子只跟国家说过三个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00180",
      "start_ms": 470620,
      "end_ms": 471565,
      "text": "说了三回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00181",
      "start_ms": 471950,
      "end_ms": 474625,
      "text": "每一回都把自己赔进去一点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00182",
      "start_ms": 475080,
      "end_ms": 476080,
      "text": "三回下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00183",
      "start_ms": 476300,
      "end_ms": 478075,
      "text": "把自己赔的干干净净。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00184",
      "start_ms": 478320,
      "end_ms": 478880,
      "text": "这三回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00185",
      "start_ms": 478880,
      "end_ms": 481375,
      "text": "我愿意每一回他失去了什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00186",
      "start_ms": 481590,
      "end_ms": 482885,
      "text": "国家又得到了什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00187",
      "start_ms": 483390,
      "end_ms": 485545,
      "text": "我一笔一笔给你算清楚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00188",
      "start_ms": 485840,
      "end_ms": 489655,
      "text": "点赞、收藏并转发给您身边最亲的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00189",
      "start_ms": 490320,
      "end_ms": 490955,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_2fe34883cba71ae1_s00190",
      "start_ms": 491190,
      "end_ms": 492615,
      "text": "下一集我继续讲。"
    }
  ],
